    Component {
      Type          Subsystem
      Name          "OpenLoopVHzController"
      Show          on
      Position      [625, 85]
      Direction     up
      Flipped       off
      LabelPosition south
      Frame         [-50, -30; 50, 30]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "OpenLoopVHzController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Open-loop V/Hz controller (OpenLoopVHzController): the stator voltage reference is given by the V/Hz curve u_s_ref as a function of the stator angular frequency w_s = n_p*w_M, where w_M is the rate-limited speed reference, in coordinates rotating at w_s. The curve is affine, u_s_ref = u_0 + k*w_s, given by the voltage u_0 at zero frequency and the slope k. The output fbk.u_s is the converter voltage u_c_ab averaged over the previous and ongoing periods (DriveControlSystem.get_feedback)."
      MaskInit      "% Coefficients of the V/Hz curve u_s_ref for the C-Script\nu_s_ref_u_0 = u_s_ref.u_0;\nu_s_ref_k = u_s_ref.k;\n"
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
