        Show          off
        Tunable       on
        TabName       ""
      }
      Parameter {
        Variable      "u_s_ref"
        Prompt        "u_s_ref: V/Hz curve u_0 + k*w_s as a struct of the coefficients u_0 (V) and k (Vs), each [real part, imaginary part]"
        Type          FreeText
        Value         "vhz_ctrl.u_s_ref"
        Show          off
        Tunable       on
        TabName       ""
